## Questions People Ask About SEVENTEEN Sun Signs

**Are SEVENTEEN zodiac signs the same as full birth charts?**

No. They are Sun-sign lookups based on official birth dates, while full birth charts require birth time, place, and chart calculation.

**What zodiac signs are most common in SEVENTEEN?**

Aquarius appears three times through DINO, DK, and Vernon. Gemini appears twice through JUN and HOSHI, and Capricorn appears twice through SEUNGKWAN and JOSHUA.

**Can I read rising signs for SEVENTEEN members?**

Not from the official PLEDIS profile alone. Rising signs require birth times, and those times are not published there.

**Why do some lists disagree about cusp members?**

Cusp dates can be handled by broad date ranges or by exact solar ingress timing. This page uses official dates and stays transparent about the limits of date-only reading.

